# Example only — do NOT expose an unauthenticated MCP HTTP endpoint to the public internet.
# ChatGPT custom connectors / developer MCP typically require a reachable HTTPS URL,
# an eligible plan, and administrator enablement. Verify current OpenAI docs before deploying.
#
# PEN_MCP_HTTP_HOST=127.0.0.1
# PEN_MCP_HTTP_PORT=8765
# PEN_MCP_AUTH_TOKEN=replace-with-long-random-token
#
# Suggested local bind for testing:
#   python -c "from mcp_server.server import mcp; mcp.run(transport='streamable-http', host='127.0.0.1', port=8765)"
# Put a reverse proxy with TLS + auth in front before any remote ChatGPT connector use.
